{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411190","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1541119001:1":{"text":"呼临人手里，拿着很多褐色的圆片。","source_cn":"呼临人手里，拿着很多褐色的圆片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBECBBC1B2AC95DDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1541119002:1":{"text":"有个女人把它交给坐在地上的男人，然后，带走了那个男人的陶罐。","source_cn":"有个女人把它交给坐在地上的男人，然后，带走了那个男人的陶罐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0924BF677105976B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541119003:1":{"text":"但是，被拿走陶罐的男人没有追她……为什么？那些圆片是什么？","source_cn":"但是，被拿走陶罐的男人没有追她……为什么？那些圆片是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81760CBE206B2167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541119004:1":{"text":"那些圆片是铜币，是这片区域流通的货币。","source_cn":"那些圆片是铜币，是这片区域流通的货币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3994BA76E591557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541119005:1":{"text":"货币……是什么？","source_cn":"货币……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE09F7E901037542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1541119005":{"text":"货币……是什么？","source_cn":"货币……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE09F7E901037542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541119006:1":{"text":"钱，又是什么？","source_cn":"钱，又是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA20E6E7F5E5AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541119008:1":{"text":"你可以认为，“货币”是一种能够衡量事物价值的特殊物品。","source_cn":"你可以认为，“货币”是一种能够衡量事物价值的特殊物品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBE8BEA4CDCA68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541119009:1":{"text":"举例来说，如果十颗斑斓可可能换到一块兽肉，那么就可以简单地理解为：一颗斑斓可可价值一枚货币，一块兽肉价值十枚货币。","source_cn":"举例来说，如果十颗斑斓可可能换到一块兽肉，那么就可以简...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F7E6D9D321A1051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541119010:1":{"text":"在此基础上，就可以计算出更多东西的价值，用相应的货币购买。","source_cn":"在此基础上，就可以计算出更多东西的价值，用相应的货币购买。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B40918135B23AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541119011:1":{"text":"……原来是这样。","source_cn":"……原来是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11736CC97BD4B8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541119012:1":{"text":"有了货币，只需要两颗斑斓可可的时候，就不用拿一整块兽肉去换十颗。对吗？","source_cn":"有了货币，只需要两颗斑斓可可的时候，就不用拿一整块兽肉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x898B08C6DFFE380E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541119013:1":{"text":"没错，是这样。","source_cn":"没错，是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1433B1AFA7080034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541119014:1":{"text":"货币是凡人智慧的结晶，也是文明发展到一定阶段必然出现的产物。","source_cn":"货币是凡人智慧的结晶，也是文明发展到一定阶段必然出现的产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x503153DCF519838D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541119015:1":{"text":"虽然雅库伯尔会将狩猎和采集获得的战利品和食物都汇总到一起，再根据功劳分配给每个人，但必然难以满足所有人的需求，所以才会出现以物易物的市集。","source_cn":"虽然雅库伯尔会将狩猎和采集获得的战利品和食物都汇总到一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53E4D63BBC222084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1541119016:1":{"text":"嗯，货币很方便，比交换更方便。","source_cn":"嗯，货币很方便，比交换更方便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BBA5CE4A179614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fem